From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: integrate native radio, channel and role lifetimes

Publish physical AP/STA identity and final supported capabilities. Serialize
shared-channel, DFS, CSA, scan and exclusive RX-monitor ownership. Preserve
normal completion, cancellation and terminal return without monitor TX.

This is the final native integration against the pinned vendor source.
Firmware-dependent policy remains downstream with exact image admission.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

